{"code":"iba","quarters":[{"id":"2026-01","title":"Nyerakupka Serega enggau Dunya: Kristus dalam Pilipi enggau Kolosi","description":"Perundingka pengawa ke pemadu pedis udah dikereja nuan. Nama ti ngasuh iya pedis? Kati nya ketegal pengarap ati orang, tauka timpuh ti diberi kena ngereja iya, tauka kedua-dua nya sekali? Kati nya ketegal sikap nuan senentang pengawa nya? Tauka ketegal orang ke enggau nuan ngereja pengawa nya? Tauka pengawa nya baka ti nadai jalai ulih dikereja enggau mujur, kini?","human_date":"January · February · March 2026","start_date":"27/12/2025","end_date":"27/03/2026","color_primary":"#2E4161","color_primary_dark":"#1E2C44","splash":true,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Diperinsa Tang Enda Ditinggalka","start_date":"27/12/2025","end_date":"02/01/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Kebuah Beterima Kasih Sereta Besampi","start_date":"03/01/2026","end_date":"09/01/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Pengidup enggau Pemati","start_date":"10/01/2026","end_date":"16/01/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Penyerakup Nengah Pemaruh Ati","start_date":"17/01/2026","end_date":"23/01/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Bepanchar Baka Penampak Dalam Petang Malam","start_date":"24/01/2026","end_date":"30/01/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Manggaika Pengarap Semina ba Kristus Aja","start_date":"31/01/2026","end_date":"06/02/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Peranak Menua Serega","start_date":"07/02/2026","end_date":"13/02/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"“Keunggulan” Kristus","start_date":"14/02/2026","end_date":"20/02/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Pengawa Bebaik Enggau Pengadang","start_date":"21/02/2026","end_date":"27/02/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Lengkap Dalam Kristus","start_date":"28/02/2026","end_date":"06/03/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Idup enggau Kristus","start_date":"07/03/2026","end_date":"13/03/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Idup Begulai enggau Pangan Diri","start_date":"14/03/2026","end_date":"20/03/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Diau Dalam Semua Peneka Allah Taala","start_date":"