 Enggau Saksi Orang Kristen","description":"Betulis surat nya endang pengawa ari kelia kala ti enda deka badu pia aja. Kitai semina udah ngubah chara kitai betuliska surat. Ya, media sosial udah ngalahka keretas. Tang, taja pia, dalam ayu iya, email enggau surat elektronik dalam bentuk bukai sama ngereja fungsi ti sama: iya nya, nyambung orang ngagai pangan diri ari betukarka info, asai ati, enggau runding.","human_date":"July · August · September 2026","start_date":"27/06/2026","end_date":"25/09/2026","color_primary":"#605045","color_primary_dark":"#4B3C32","splash":true,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Pelayanan Paul di Korint","start_date":"27/06/2026","end_date":"03/07/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Pesan Pasal Regang","start_date":"04/07/2026","end_date":"10/07/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Penyerakup Dalam Kristus","start_date":"11/07/2026","end_date":"17/07/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Dosa di Dalam Gerija","start_date":"18/07/2026","end_date":"24/07/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Semua Utai ke Mulia Allah Taala","start_date":"25/07/2026","end_date":"31/07/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Pemeri Ari Roh","start_date":"01/08/2026","end_date":"07/08/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Potret [Gambar] Pengerindu","start_date":"08/08/2026","end_date":"14/08/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Kuasa Pengangkat Kristus","start_date":"15/08/2026","end_date":"21/08/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Ministry ke Diapi Pengerindu","start_date":"22/08/2026","end_date":"28/08/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Pelayanan Kristen ke Tulin","start_date":"29/08/2026","end_date":"04/09/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Penatalayan Enggau Misi","start_date":"05/09/2026","end_date":"11/09/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Napi Bala Pengajar ti Pelesu","start_date":"12/09/2026","end_date":"18/09/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Pengasih, Pengerindu, enggau Kaul","start_date":"19/09/2026","end_date":"25/09/2026"}]}]}